WEBVTT

00:40.290 --> 00:45.003
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:46.004 --> 00:49.382
I often imagined myself standing alone
on top of a very tall tree.

00:50.425 --> 00:54.137
I knew no one
and I felt so helpless with no one around.

00:56.264 --> 00:58.224
I was hoping
someone would come and rescue me.

01:00.769 --> 01:01.811
And then you came.

01:03.730 --> 01:04.647
What…

01:06.691 --> 01:07.776
What are you talking about?

01:09.611 --> 01:11.613
It's just my fantasy.

01:13.656 --> 01:16.326
I told you there was something
I kept thinking about in that room.

01:17.494 --> 01:19.370
I promise you I don't have that stone!

01:38.389 --> 01:39.390
I must have…

01:42.310 --> 01:43.561
gone crazy because of you.

01:48.858 --> 01:50.276
Why do you keep confusing me?

01:51.444 --> 01:52.695
Why are you so confused?

01:53.822 --> 01:55.698
You hold my hand and listen to my stories…

01:56.991 --> 01:58.493
only to think about someone else.

02:00.870 --> 02:04.457
If you miss her so much you think
you'll go crazy, let me help you more.

02:04.541 --> 02:06.584
Should I just do everything
she once did for you?

02:06.668 --> 02:08.128
Well, since you are so mad--

02:08.211 --> 02:10.130
A tree like that actually exists.

02:12.173 --> 02:13.925
A very big, tall tree.

02:14.008 --> 02:16.302
There really is a tree
that we had promised…

02:17.887 --> 02:18.847
to climb together.

02:19.889 --> 02:21.182
You mean in Danhyanggok?

02:24.394 --> 02:27.814
Uh, that's right?
Oh, I wonder how I know that.

02:29.065 --> 02:30.900
Maybe I went there once.

02:33.069 --> 02:35.155
This is why I have problems
believing to your stories.

02:37.824 --> 02:39.409
Believe it if you want, okay?

02:40.326 --> 02:42.120
Regardless, this hand is mine.

02:42.912 --> 02:46.374
If I hold you or rock you to sleep,
that's me, all right?

02:46.958 --> 02:47.792
So…

02:48.376 --> 02:50.879
when you're looking at me like this,
see me for who I am…

02:52.797 --> 02:54.007
like that night.

02:57.093 --> 02:58.553
I'm not dreaming anymore.

02:59.137 --> 03:00.972
- Do you know who I am then?
- Yeah.

03:02.348 --> 03:03.391
You're the one who woke me up.

03:08.563 --> 03:09.939
Someone just entered from over there.

03:12.108 --> 03:13.568
I can see their energy

03:14.652 --> 03:15.904
behind that tree there.

03:18.990 --> 03:22.076
But I think
the energy belongs to someone I know.

03:22.160 --> 03:24.370
Who? Someone from Jinyowon?

03:25.121 --> 03:25.955
Ah, no.

03:27.332 --> 03:28.458
It's your friend, Jang Uk.

03:37.258 --> 03:38.259
Seo Yul?

03:38.885 --> 03:39.719
Jang Uk?

03:44.974 --> 03:46.351
It really is you.

03:48.478 --> 03:50.521
I was wondering.
She said she could see you.

03:50.605 --> 03:51.856
What are you doing here?

03:51.940 --> 03:53.733
I'm here
because I have to look for someone.

03:56.527 --> 03:58.446
There's a way to take out the parasite.

03:58.529 --> 04:01.574
If you tell me who knows,
I'll let them live.

04:04.118 --> 04:05.203
I knew it.

04:06.579 --> 04:09.415
So there is a way
to take out the parasite.

04:09.499 --> 04:11.125
Yes. Who is it?

04:12.168 --> 04:13.002
Tell me.

04:16.256 --> 04:18.174
- It's Jin Mu, my lord.
- Jin Mu?

04:18.675 --> 04:19.509
No, it's…

04:21.052 --> 04:23.221
It's actually Park Jin of Songrim.

04:26.724 --> 04:27.558
What?

04:27.642 --> 04:28.893
Actually…

04:32.814 --> 04:34.565
It's His Majesty the King.

04:42.824 --> 04:45.535
I was going to grant you
a painless death if you told me.

04:46.202 --> 04:47.453
I see what I must do now.

04:49.414 --> 04:51.582
Let's see
if you still won't tell me the truth

04:52.208 --> 04:53.418
after you take this.

05:04.679 --> 05:05.555
Lady Jin.

05:07.849 --> 05:09.726
Jang Uk wishes to see you, my lady.

05:09.809 --> 05:11.811
Now? Tell him I've gone to bed.

05:11.894 --> 05:13.479
He already knows you're not in your room.

05:13.563 --> 05:16.274
It won't be good
if he starts looking around.

05:29.162 --> 05:30.455
What brings you here now?

05:30.538 --> 05:32.081
I came here to ask you for a favor.

05:32.790 --> 05:36.002
Please, allow me to enter Jinyowon
for just a moment.

05:36.586 --> 05:37.420
Jinyowon?

05:37.503 --> 05:40.173
Bu-yeon might have just secretly let me in
if I asked,

05:40.256 --> 05:43.009
but that didn't seem appropriate,
so I'm asking you.

06:05.865 --> 06:07.617
So-i, wake up.

06:08.368 --> 06:09.827
So-i, do you recognize me?

06:10.870 --> 06:11.704
Seo Yul?

06:12.497 --> 06:13.581
Good.

06:15.333 --> 06:16.292
Hold on to me.

06:19.212 --> 06:20.713
She says there's a way.

06:23.299 --> 06:26.135
Jin Ho-gyeong says
there's a way to get rid of the parasite.

06:26.761 --> 06:27.595
We have no time.

06:28.221 --> 06:29.138
Let's talk outside.

06:32.016 --> 06:33.142
Jin Bu-yeon?

06:33.226 --> 06:36.104
Are you okay? Did my mother do this?

06:38.648 --> 06:41.651
So you really think
that you're Jin Bu-yeon then.

06:41.734 --> 06:43.027
What do you mean?

06:46.280 --> 06:47.407
She helped me find you.

06:48.866 --> 06:50.076
We need to leave now.

07:03.423 --> 07:05.842
This is the fire bird.

07:06.926 --> 07:08.553
I see it hasn't hatched yet.

07:08.636 --> 07:11.347
If the fire bird hatches
and flies to the sky,

07:11.431 --> 07:13.349
the entire world will dry out.

07:13.433 --> 07:14.851
If the egg is taken,

07:15.685 --> 07:16.727
Jinyowon will crumble?

07:18.312 --> 07:19.147
Oh.

07:20.064 --> 07:22.650
I would never take it from you,
so don't worry, Lady Jin.

07:22.733 --> 07:24.360
It's strange! Master Lee…

07:24.444 --> 07:26.612
could have just asked me
to show this to him.

07:27.947 --> 07:30.616
Why would he ask you to come check?

07:30.700 --> 07:32.160
Because he doesn't trust you.

07:32.869 --> 07:35.121
You once revealed the ice stone
without thinking twice.

07:35.830 --> 07:38.916
That was the decision I made
to save my unborn daughter, Bu-yeon.

07:39.917 --> 07:43.004
The person
who didn't return it after using it

07:43.713 --> 07:45.214
was your father, Jang Gang, no?

07:46.716 --> 07:50.803
In the end,
that stone wound up inside his son.

07:52.680 --> 07:54.765
I guess there're too many reasons
for you to hate me,

07:54.849 --> 07:57.059
for us to ever actually
get along with each other.

07:57.143 --> 07:59.687
That's the reason I wanted
to put an end to all of this.

08:00.521 --> 08:02.190
She was fine under my protection.

08:02.773 --> 08:04.192
Why would you take her from me?

08:04.275 --> 08:05.359
Yes, why?

08:06.402 --> 08:07.904
I saw the reality of your protection.

08:09.071 --> 08:11.949
That dismal room
and the thread sewn into her back

08:12.033 --> 08:13.951
was really the protection
of a loving mother?

08:14.785 --> 08:16.037
Just fine, really?

08:16.662 --> 08:17.497
Ah.

08:18.206 --> 08:20.082
Is that what you consider love, Lady Jin?

08:21.042 --> 08:23.419
Poking somebody with needles in dark room?

08:23.503 --> 08:24.754
No, I had to do it

08:25.546 --> 08:27.048
to protect her. She's my eldest.

08:27.131 --> 08:29.133
She has a duty to fulfill.

08:29.217 --> 08:31.219
Protect Jinyowon
by carrying on the family line.

08:31.302 --> 08:32.803
Are you trying to pressure me right now?

08:37.433 --> 08:39.977
Then you could have at least
served a brood hen for dinner.

08:40.895 --> 08:43.356
But then again,
you showed me this fire bird instead.

08:43.439 --> 08:45.066
I guess that's positive.

08:56.327 --> 08:58.246
The person
Seo Yul was looking for was hurt bad.

08:58.329 --> 08:59.997
- Who was it?
- A woman.

09:00.540 --> 09:02.667
Her name was So-i, I think.

09:05.711 --> 09:06.546
So-i?

09:19.225 --> 09:20.935
Seeing as how you saved me…

09:22.728 --> 09:24.689
I guess you got the message I sent you.

09:25.314 --> 09:26.148
Yes.

09:26.983 --> 09:28.067
It's the truth.

09:28.150 --> 09:30.194
Mu-deok, who's from Sari Village…

09:32.113 --> 09:33.864
is Ho-gyeong's real daughter.

09:33.948 --> 09:36.325
Then that means that
the current Jin Bu-yeon is a fake one?

09:40.663 --> 09:43.124
I came to see her
because that's what I thought also.

09:44.834 --> 09:46.294
But she's actually her daughter.

09:47.253 --> 09:49.130
- What?
- Ho-gyeong said

09:49.213 --> 09:52.425
she took Mu-deok's dead body
out of Lake Gyeongcheondaeho

09:52.508 --> 09:53.426
and saved her.

09:53.509 --> 09:56.721
But that the soul
still within the body was…

09:58.514 --> 09:59.348
Naksu.

10:02.435 --> 10:03.352
Naksu?

10:03.436 --> 10:04.270
Yes.

10:05.271 --> 10:07.565
Naksu is alive within Jin Bu-yeon's body.

10:08.774 --> 10:10.693
But Jin Bu-yeon's current face is…

10:11.986 --> 10:13.279
Naksu's face.

10:25.875 --> 10:27.335
No wonder she looks so familiar.

10:28.461 --> 10:30.671
I failed to recognize her
because I never imagined

10:31.380 --> 10:32.673
that I'd see her again.

10:34.800 --> 10:35.635
There you are.

11:17.760 --> 11:18.969
She is alive.

11:21.055 --> 11:21.931
Jin Bu-yeon…

11:23.641 --> 11:24.767
was her all along.

11:34.026 --> 11:35.027
Are you all right?

11:42.076 --> 11:43.703
You're about to cry, Yul.

11:46.956 --> 11:47.790
Are you…

11:49.041 --> 11:50.000
feeling sick still?

11:58.551 --> 11:59.635
What's wrong?

12:00.219 --> 12:01.303
Does it hurt?

12:02.930 --> 12:04.432
I'm very confused right now.

12:05.683 --> 12:07.143
I'm afraid I've lost my way.

12:09.061 --> 12:10.020
For a moment…

12:11.731 --> 12:13.065
For a moment, I'll stay like this.

12:49.268 --> 12:50.895
I can't let you stay like this, Yul.

12:51.437 --> 12:53.898
I think that it's best I tell Jang Uk.

12:58.194 --> 12:59.195
Don't tell him.

13:01.363 --> 13:02.782
I don't wish for him to find out.

13:14.084 --> 13:15.544
We haven't done anything wrong.

13:17.254 --> 13:20.466
Seo Yul… Seo Yul is
the one that let us in.

13:20.549 --> 13:21.383
Seo Yul did?

13:24.011 --> 13:24.845
He's right.

13:28.432 --> 13:30.643
It's all true. Let him go.

13:36.482 --> 13:39.068
What happened?
I heard the girl you saved is So-i.

13:40.486 --> 13:41.695
So why are you helping her?

13:42.279 --> 13:43.322
Did she do something to you?

13:43.405 --> 13:44.406
Don't worry.

13:45.157 --> 13:46.784
I was, in fact, indebted to her.

13:47.868 --> 13:51.288
So I tried to return the favor
by helping her escape.

13:51.372 --> 13:53.249
Okay, but why are you indebted to her?

13:53.332 --> 13:55.376
She cared for me when I was hurt,

13:56.293 --> 13:57.628
trapped inside the barrier.

13:58.462 --> 13:59.672
Young Lady Heo also knows.

14:01.048 --> 14:01.882
I see.

14:03.217 --> 14:05.594
Still, you snuck in Jinyowon.
That's dangerous!

14:08.180 --> 14:10.349
Well, you helped me out, thank you.

14:14.937 --> 14:17.731
Anything else I should know
or can help you with?

14:19.650 --> 14:21.318
Not now. This has to be my burden.

14:22.945 --> 14:23.988
It's on me this time.

14:34.248 --> 14:37.960
He was too fast for us to see his face,
but it was for sure a man.

14:38.544 --> 14:39.420
Who could it be?

14:40.129 --> 14:41.589
It's Jin Mu, my lord.

14:41.672 --> 14:42.506
No, it's…

14:44.008 --> 14:46.093
It's actually Park Jin of Songrim.

14:46.802 --> 14:48.470
It's His Majesty the King.

14:50.931 --> 14:53.100
None of them can find out about the truth.

14:54.435 --> 14:55.561
No one can know!

15:09.199 --> 15:13.913
Well, her injuries aren't severe.
She'll be fine if you apply this ointment.

15:15.623 --> 15:16.582
Thank you so much.

15:26.258 --> 15:27.134
Oh.

15:28.636 --> 15:30.137
Young Master Seo is right.

15:30.220 --> 15:33.682
So-i really took good care of him
back when he was injured.

15:34.516 --> 15:36.393
WelI, I have no reason to not believe you.

15:36.477 --> 15:40.356
She even cut herself
to share her blood and energy with him.

15:40.940 --> 15:41.941
She shared her blood with him?

15:42.024 --> 15:45.819
It didn't help that much,
but it shows how much she cared.

15:48.197 --> 15:49.448
You're staying at Jeongjingak?

15:50.366 --> 15:52.952
I'm also staying here
to take care of So-i.

16:01.251 --> 16:02.086
I thought…

16:03.045 --> 16:06.090
you and Young Master Jang
were supposed to be at Jinyowon.

16:06.173 --> 16:07.216
We just got back.

16:07.758 --> 16:09.593
We only left a bit early to help a friend.

16:09.677 --> 16:10.511
Ah.

16:11.136 --> 16:15.724
To Young Master Jang, helping his friend
must be far more important to him, right?

16:15.808 --> 16:18.185
It's not like you are any help
to his friend like my Young Lady,

16:18.268 --> 16:20.813
so you can just head home.
I'll take you, we can go together.

16:20.896 --> 16:22.606
The friend I was talking about…

16:22.690 --> 16:25.109
You should know wasn't actually
my husband's friend but mine.

16:25.192 --> 16:28.696
Then… Young Master Seo
is actually your friend too?

16:28.779 --> 16:30.656
Of course. I'm here for a reason.

16:32.574 --> 16:34.493
I need to go talk to my friend, Seo Yul.

16:34.576 --> 16:35.995
I'm gonna head upstairs now.

16:38.914 --> 16:40.374
What do you have to talk about with Yul?

16:41.709 --> 16:43.585
She says she's friends
with Young Master Seo.

16:43.669 --> 16:45.671
That's right. So I should talk to him.

16:45.754 --> 16:48.340
So then, you're not going home?

16:48.424 --> 16:50.509
Not now, I'm also going to stay.

16:54.596 --> 16:56.598
Goodbye then, Young Master Jang.

16:57.266 --> 16:58.142
Yes, see you.

16:58.225 --> 16:59.601
I'll be heading home now.

17:13.699 --> 17:14.992
Just come home with me.

17:18.620 --> 17:20.706
Okay. Fine.

17:20.789 --> 17:22.041
Let's go now.

17:40.434 --> 17:43.103
So, when did you become friends with Yul?

17:43.896 --> 17:45.022
We agreed to be friends

17:45.105 --> 17:47.691
because we are both foolish
in our own ways.

17:49.693 --> 17:52.154
You may be a fool, but Yul is far from it.

17:53.072 --> 17:54.656
He gets lost when he's flustered.

17:56.867 --> 17:57.951
He told you that?

17:58.911 --> 18:01.163
Well, I happened to find out over time.

18:01.246 --> 18:03.040
How much time
did you spend with him to know that?

18:03.123 --> 18:07.336
Well, we went to Chwiseonru together,
Gaema Village together.

18:08.462 --> 18:09.379
Ah.

18:10.297 --> 18:13.634
So-i was the one who I met
in Gaema Village before.

18:13.717 --> 18:14.885
What? When?

18:14.968 --> 18:17.679
I remember she stole something from me,
and Seo Yul helped me that day.

18:18.597 --> 18:19.431
Seriously?

18:21.975 --> 18:23.977
There's so much that happened
I don't know about.

18:25.312 --> 18:27.064
You two must be good friends.

18:28.482 --> 18:30.859
I actually thought he was the man
I was supposed to marry

18:30.943 --> 18:32.903
when we first met at Chwiseonru, you know.

18:34.238 --> 18:37.324
Had we met before,
I may have never even run away.

18:37.407 --> 18:38.283
Oh.

18:39.701 --> 18:42.955
You must be sad. Yul would…
would have made a good husband.

18:43.622 --> 18:45.249
He's handsome and kind.

18:46.667 --> 18:49.336
He wouldn't have said he was going crazy
just from holding my hand.

18:50.754 --> 18:53.048
Do you… feel fine now?

19:02.850 --> 19:04.643
You told me to see you for who you are.

19:05.602 --> 19:07.146
That is what I'm trying to do right now.

19:17.072 --> 19:19.575
Jang Uk, summon some fireflies.

19:20.868 --> 19:22.911
That is definitely not
an easy thing to do, you know.

19:24.371 --> 19:27.416
Then… how about
setting off some fireworks?

19:28.000 --> 19:30.335
Hey, you know how expensive that is, huh?

19:30.419 --> 19:33.422
Besides, where am I supposed
to find fireworks right now?

19:34.089 --> 19:36.884
Don't tell anyone Jin Bu-yeon is Naksu.

19:36.967 --> 19:38.343
Don't worry. I wouldn't do that.

19:38.427 --> 19:41.680
We need to keep the secret
so Ho-gyeong can save your life.

19:42.514 --> 19:44.099
Jang Uk must not know this either.

19:46.018 --> 19:46.935
I know that.

19:48.437 --> 19:49.771
Uk has gone through enough.

19:51.899 --> 19:52.774
So it's on me now.

19:52.858 --> 19:54.026
Why is it on you?

19:54.776 --> 19:56.945
What responsibility
do you have for Naksu though?

19:57.029 --> 19:58.530
Because I also found out.

19:59.948 --> 20:01.200
You also knew that…

20:03.160 --> 20:05.037
Mu-deok was the soul shifter Naksu?

20:08.624 --> 20:10.918
Then you kept it a secret
when you knew? Why?

20:11.001 --> 20:13.128
The physician said
that you should recover soon.

20:13.712 --> 20:16.423
I'll find you a place to stay,
so you should leave when you can.

21:26.243 --> 21:27.536
Young Master, are you okay?

21:28.704 --> 21:29.579
Does it hurt?

21:30.414 --> 21:31.873
It's just a nightmare I often have.

21:33.083 --> 21:34.960
Is it the woman who always appears…

21:36.295 --> 21:37.129
in your dreams?

21:44.136 --> 21:48.140
I understand because I also have
something that encapsulates my feelings.

21:49.224 --> 21:50.767
Since you are still holding on to it…

21:53.270 --> 21:54.479
your feelings haven't changed at all.

21:54.563 --> 21:56.732
So I should throw this away then.

21:59.693 --> 22:01.778
Because if you're right,
it means all my pain…

22:06.783 --> 22:08.035
is because I kept this.

22:14.374 --> 22:15.417
So by any chance,

22:16.585 --> 22:17.878
are you planning on getting rid of her?

22:18.962 --> 22:21.298
Then you can't receive Jinyowon's help,
and you will die too.

22:21.882 --> 22:22.924
I know.

22:23.008 --> 22:24.676
I do not plan to kill her…

22:28.388 --> 22:29.681
and still expect to live?

22:29.765 --> 22:30.766
Exactly!

22:31.266 --> 22:33.352
Exactly! You can't do that
if you wish to live.

22:35.854 --> 22:37.147
Plus, you like her, don't you?

22:45.906 --> 22:46.782
Go get some rest.

23:02.672 --> 23:03.840
Young Master.

23:07.010 --> 23:07.844
I…

23:09.262 --> 23:10.972
I am officially engaged

23:12.182 --> 23:14.267
to Lord Park Jin of Songrim.

23:19.898 --> 23:21.441
Why are you not saying anything?

23:22.818 --> 23:24.694
Are you mad at me for getting married?

23:25.654 --> 23:27.406
- Should I not?
- I… I mean…

23:28.698 --> 23:30.909
I just don't know
what to call you in such situations.

23:34.079 --> 23:36.123
Just call me Maidservant Kim, please.

23:36.206 --> 23:38.250
Even if I marry Lord Park,

23:39.501 --> 23:42.712
you'll always be my dear young master.

23:43.255 --> 23:45.215
No, that's not it.

23:47.300 --> 23:49.678
You are the person
I'm most grateful for in this world,

23:51.263 --> 23:52.764
so I couldn't just say…

23:54.516 --> 23:55.767
congrats, Maidservant Kim.

23:59.938 --> 24:01.606
It doesn't matter what you call me,

24:03.442 --> 24:05.902
I may call you young master,

24:07.070 --> 24:07.904
but you…

24:09.614 --> 24:10.699
are like a son to me.

24:16.705 --> 24:17.539
I…

24:19.040 --> 24:20.333
feel the same.

24:24.296 --> 24:25.213
Maidservant Kim.

24:32.554 --> 24:33.472
Congrats!

24:37.684 --> 24:38.768
My young master.

24:48.987 --> 24:52.365
The reason we visited you last night
was to show all these.

24:53.700 --> 24:55.994
Once again,
congratulations on your engagement.

24:56.077 --> 24:58.330
Congratulations!

24:58.413 --> 25:00.081
Thank you, everyone.

25:00.165 --> 25:04.127
Gosh! I'll finally be
getting an aunt after all.

25:04.211 --> 25:06.922
Then should I look forward
to a niece or nephew?

25:10.300 --> 25:11.801
Know when to stop talking, okay?

25:11.885 --> 25:14.012
Why stop so soon?

25:14.095 --> 25:17.557
You say a bunch of these were found
in dried-up wells in and around Daeho?

25:17.641 --> 25:20.894
Yes, these boatmen here
also found some in the canal.

25:20.977 --> 25:24.022
Someone seems quite determined
to dry up all the water.

25:24.105 --> 25:27.317
I'll find out where they were created
and where exactly they're coming from.

25:27.400 --> 25:30.570
They contain the energy of a volcano,
so they're probably made there.

25:30.654 --> 25:34.032
Thoroughly examine all the items
that come in from the far south.

25:34.991 --> 25:35.825
Yes.

25:41.206 --> 25:44.209
Songrim will be inspecting
incoming goods on all the boats?

25:44.292 --> 25:48.088
Yes. I can no longer make an exception
for your boat to pass.

25:54.469 --> 25:57.973
I think the boat from the volcano
should be arriving at Daeho Fortress soon.

26:00.308 --> 26:02.936
Send a homing bird
and tell them to discard everything.

26:03.019 --> 26:03.853
Yes, lord.

26:23.623 --> 26:25.041
He wants us to get rid of all of it?

26:25.709 --> 26:28.503
But is it okay to discard
such things into the lake?

26:28.587 --> 26:31.256
Quiet! We just need to do
what we are told.

26:32.007 --> 26:33.049
Get on with it.

26:38.471 --> 26:41.266
I checked the fire bird in Jinyowon.

26:41.349 --> 26:44.894
It was much smaller than I expected,
but it was safe and sound.

26:44.978 --> 26:45.812
Really?

26:46.396 --> 26:48.607
I thought
that you didn't want to get involved.

26:49.232 --> 26:51.484
I mean I had to go anyway,
so I just checked while I was there.

26:51.568 --> 26:54.362
You don't usually lift a finger
if you don't want to.

26:54.446 --> 26:55.739
You actually went there and checked?

26:56.865 --> 26:58.658
I really don't wish to get involved.

26:59.576 --> 27:00.994
I'm only telling you because I heard it.

27:01.077 --> 27:04.497
There are so many people
who want the fire bird.

27:05.206 --> 27:06.416
There's unrest all over

27:06.499 --> 27:09.044
as the drought has dried up
all the wells and canals.

27:09.628 --> 27:11.630
Please allow
the Unanimous Assembly to gather

27:11.713 --> 27:14.507
so we can advance
the rite of the lake now, Sire.

27:14.591 --> 27:15.425
It's strange

27:15.508 --> 27:19.387
that even the wells and canals
are drying up because of the drought.

27:19.471 --> 27:22.515
Fortunately, since Jang Uk
got rid of Naksu,

27:22.599 --> 27:25.644
the fear of soul shifters in the capital
has died down considerably.

27:26.770 --> 27:29.689
Crown Prince, visit Jang Uk
and reward him like always.

27:30.273 --> 27:33.860
Majesty, you must give him
a bigger reward this time.

27:36.404 --> 27:39.366
Appoint him as the general
of the North Fortress and send him.

27:40.742 --> 27:41.701
You want…

27:42.494 --> 27:44.412
me to send him outside of Daeho?

27:44.996 --> 27:47.832
Without him, the people
in the capital will grow uneasy.

27:47.916 --> 27:52.295
Right now, Cheonbugwan has arguably
more mages than Songrim has ever had.

27:52.837 --> 27:55.256
If the Crown Prince,
who has been chosen by the King's Star,

27:55.340 --> 27:57.050
takes lead of these mages,

27:57.676 --> 27:59.594
no one will be anxious again.

28:10.146 --> 28:12.691
When the world suffered
from drought 200 years ago,

28:12.774 --> 28:14.567
the ice stone fell from the sky.

28:14.651 --> 28:16.277
It looks like these people

28:16.361 --> 28:18.655
are trying to do the same thing
by waking the bird.

28:18.738 --> 28:22.117
The royal family and Cheonbugwan
are the ones that are behind it.

28:22.867 --> 28:26.329
Do you wish that I fight against them
and put an end to it, Master Lee?

28:26.413 --> 28:28.873
A fight like that
would be considered a revolt.

28:32.544 --> 28:33.920
If you did win the fight,

28:34.796 --> 28:37.382
you could even find yourself
on the throne.

28:39.259 --> 28:40.176
What?

28:40.260 --> 28:41.511
You already know that as well.

28:41.594 --> 28:44.097
The King's Star,
which is believed to be the Prince's,

28:45.014 --> 28:46.725
rightfully belongs to you.

28:50.478 --> 28:53.398
Then that means you also know
who your real father is.

28:55.150 --> 28:57.360
How long do you plan to keep me in here?

28:57.444 --> 28:58.820
Just because I wish…

28:59.821 --> 29:01.072
to keep you locked up…

29:02.574 --> 29:03.575
doesn't mean I can.

29:03.658 --> 29:05.702
You possess the power of the ice stone.

29:06.870 --> 29:08.705
I know you're holding back for my sake.

29:08.788 --> 29:09.831
This was…

29:10.874 --> 29:13.293
Jin Mu and the royal family
who's been supporting him.

29:13.376 --> 29:14.586
I won't stop until I find out

29:14.669 --> 29:16.254
- what they did to her.
- And do what?

29:18.298 --> 29:19.966
Will you go and kill all of them?

29:20.049 --> 29:22.218
Like you said, it's not impossible
with the power I have now.

29:22.302 --> 29:24.846
To fight against Cheonbugwan
and the royal family is treason.

29:25.764 --> 29:28.391
Do you mean to use your power
to throw the world into chaos?

29:28.475 --> 29:29.642
Who cares!

29:32.270 --> 29:34.022
This world is the last thing I care about.

29:35.732 --> 29:38.276
The one person in this world
I wanted to protect died…

29:40.445 --> 29:41.780
in the most brutal way possible.

29:51.164 --> 29:52.081
This is…

29:55.376 --> 29:58.087
the gold plaque and letter
that the father…

29:59.714 --> 30:02.550
that you have been wondering about
left just for you.

30:06.554 --> 30:08.264
Jang Gang briefly switched bodies

30:08.348 --> 30:10.266
with your father
using the alchemy of souls.

30:10.934 --> 30:14.521
The baby your mother gave birth to
after that man's soul pursued her…

30:16.189 --> 30:17.023
is you, Uk.

30:18.316 --> 30:20.985
You are the son of the late King.

30:23.988 --> 30:25.657
Born by the alchemy of souls.

30:27.075 --> 30:28.868
A boy who couldn't have been born

30:30.286 --> 30:31.871
and shouldn't have been born as well.

30:31.955 --> 30:32.914
Are you saying that…

30:34.541 --> 30:36.209
simply being born is a crime in itself?

30:36.292 --> 30:37.544
The night of your birth…

30:39.170 --> 30:40.338
the King's Star appeared.

30:42.882 --> 30:46.261
And to conceal that,
Naksu's father, Cho Chung, died.

30:46.845 --> 30:49.681
Jang Gang also died
to take responsibility for it,

30:49.764 --> 30:51.099
to keep it all a secret.

30:51.182 --> 30:53.059
The one person you wished to protect too…

30:55.186 --> 30:58.147
was probably used and killed
by those who wanted you dead.

31:09.951 --> 31:11.619
If you try to use the power

31:12.495 --> 31:14.289
that you gained by the King's Star

31:14.372 --> 31:16.958
merely to bring the entire world
into chaos, then I, too…

31:20.336 --> 31:22.046
will stop you even if…

31:24.132 --> 31:25.008
I die.

31:41.190 --> 31:42.609
I found myself already guilty

31:43.610 --> 31:45.361
of existing when I should not.

31:46.529 --> 31:49.324
From that moment,
I vowed to not do anything.

31:49.407 --> 31:50.241
Jang Uk.

31:51.242 --> 31:53.244
"If you won't do anything, then just die."

31:55.580 --> 31:57.457
That's what your master
always used to tell you.

31:58.708 --> 32:00.752
My master, Master Seo Gyeong,

32:00.835 --> 32:03.212
was also born
with the energy of the King's Star,

32:03.296 --> 32:04.547
but he didn't become King.

32:04.631 --> 32:06.841
Instead, he protected the world.

32:06.925 --> 32:09.177
How can I protect the world
when I couldn't even…

32:10.678 --> 32:12.055
protect just one person?

32:13.848 --> 32:16.392
I suppose you are not thrilled
to have such power

32:17.727 --> 32:19.020
since you acquired it by…

32:19.103 --> 32:21.773
- getting killed by that person.
- That Master Seo Gyeong.

32:22.815 --> 32:24.484
Why did he choose
to leave the ice stone behind?

32:24.567 --> 32:26.861
Did you not know
that he wrote in Words of the Heart

32:26.945 --> 32:28.738
that he left it to save Jin Seol-ran?

32:28.821 --> 32:30.365
But Jin Seol-ran died in the end.

32:30.448 --> 32:33.409
So then why did he keep it
inside Jinyowon?

32:33.493 --> 32:35.912
Maybe he left it for you.
You're born the same way.

32:38.790 --> 32:39.624
I'm leaving.

33:00.979 --> 33:01.813
We found them, sir.

33:05.775 --> 33:06.818
They really are here.

33:10.196 --> 33:11.114
You're so incredible.

33:12.782 --> 33:16.244
I can see why people are saying
that you remind them of Jin Seol-ran.

33:16.327 --> 33:18.997
To see the energy of all these
is quite amazing.

33:20.081 --> 33:22.792
That's all I can really do for now.

33:22.875 --> 33:25.044
You said your powers
would return with your memories.

33:26.004 --> 33:28.631
Then tell me.
Have you regained many memories?

33:30.258 --> 33:32.135
Yes, I've seen several actually.

33:33.261 --> 33:34.303
But they aren't really mine.

33:36.139 --> 33:39.267
I'm able to see
other people's memories as well.

33:40.351 --> 33:43.229
It seems
my divine powers are getting stronger.

33:43.813 --> 33:46.274
I see. I'm really glad to hear that.

33:49.152 --> 33:52.363
If those red birds are dangerous,
should I keep looking for them?

33:53.364 --> 33:54.449
Yes, please, if you would.

33:55.116 --> 33:56.534
I suppose I can avoid

33:56.617 --> 33:59.537
objects with dangerous energy
when I'm with you by my side.

34:00.663 --> 34:02.665
People with bad energy
should be avoided also.

34:03.708 --> 34:05.543
So you've seen anyone like that?

34:06.586 --> 34:08.755
People's energy is not always consistent.

34:08.838 --> 34:10.631
Some are so bad that…

34:10.715 --> 34:12.842
it's practically suffocating
being close to them.

34:18.514 --> 34:21.017
People say you,
Jin Cho-yeon, resemble spring,

34:21.100 --> 34:23.436
the most beautiful season among the four.

34:25.188 --> 34:26.230
You truly are

34:27.231 --> 34:29.192
overflowing with a beautiful liveliness.

34:30.693 --> 34:31.778
Thank you so much.

34:36.032 --> 34:38.117
A withered person like me here…

34:39.827 --> 34:42.705
is desperate for the spring.

34:51.881 --> 34:54.842
I have taken a liking to you. Visit often.

34:56.260 --> 34:58.429
I would like to get a glimpse now and then

34:59.472 --> 35:01.641
of the spring that is to come.

35:03.434 --> 35:04.268
Yeah.

35:11.734 --> 35:15.404
Royal Highness, why do you suddenly wish
to hunt so far away?

35:15.488 --> 35:16.989
It's suffocating being here.

35:18.116 --> 35:20.201
I wish to depart
as soon as possible, so pack lightly.

35:21.160 --> 35:22.328
Yes, Your Highness.

35:34.090 --> 35:36.008
Let me know right away
if you see the energy.

35:36.092 --> 35:37.969
- And we'll stop the boat there.
- Of course.

35:44.016 --> 35:45.268
Wait! Stop the boat.

35:46.102 --> 35:47.186
Stop now.

35:57.071 --> 35:59.991
I definitely remember
dangling like this from here once.

36:00.491 --> 36:01.325
When?

36:01.409 --> 36:02.410
Why?

36:03.911 --> 36:04.871
Am I so weak?

36:11.919 --> 36:15.464
Wh-What's the matter?
Why did you suddenly dangle from there?

36:16.549 --> 36:17.800
I dangled from there

36:18.885 --> 36:20.678
and realized
that I didn't have any strength.

36:22.597 --> 36:24.223
Ah… right.

36:25.224 --> 36:27.018
It seems like you are exhausted.

36:27.643 --> 36:30.813
I think it is best
that you get some rest soon.

36:37.069 --> 36:38.237
This is my memory.

36:39.197 --> 36:41.032
I even remember my arms hurting.

36:49.040 --> 36:51.042
Can't believe I forgot
to take the turtle with me.

36:51.125 --> 36:52.460
I almost left it here alone.

36:53.002 --> 36:55.004
I told the owner of the inn
to take care of it.

36:55.087 --> 36:58.007
Still, imagine how anxious it'll be
if its owner doesn't show.

37:05.306 --> 37:06.849
Please go and get some fresh air,
Eunuch Oh.

37:06.933 --> 37:09.101
- Huh?
- Go wait outside.

37:10.019 --> 37:10.853
Ah.

37:11.479 --> 37:12.480
Yes, Your Highness.

37:21.906 --> 37:23.658
"My strength has disappeared…"

37:25.076 --> 37:26.786
Does that mean I was strong before then?

37:28.955 --> 37:30.498
It doesn't like it.

37:30.581 --> 37:32.625
Eunuch Oh. Hello again.

37:33.251 --> 37:35.544
That turtle only likes to eat
meat wrapped in lettuce.

37:35.628 --> 37:37.213
- Seriously?
- Are you that dumb?

37:37.296 --> 37:39.507
It's only refusing you
because you're not its owner.

37:40.925 --> 37:41.759
Here, watch.

37:42.551 --> 37:44.929
Look here, turtle. Have some lettuce.

37:45.429 --> 37:46.264
Eat up.

37:50.351 --> 37:54.230
You see? It only cares for me. So clever!

37:54.313 --> 37:55.648
You see how fast it moved?

37:55.731 --> 37:58.067
I bet he's the fastest turtle
in all of Daeho.

37:58.776 --> 38:01.779
This turtle's so lucky
to have someone so kind.

38:03.698 --> 38:04.532
Why?

38:05.241 --> 38:07.493
Why do you say that?
Has your husband not come back yet?

38:08.327 --> 38:10.121
He does come home more often now,

38:11.080 --> 38:12.290
but I'm still alone.

38:12.373 --> 38:14.417
Why live that way? You're a shaman.

38:14.500 --> 38:16.961
You should use a curse charm
on the peacock and have her leave.

38:17.461 --> 38:19.880
Or just feed your husband a potion
that will make him like you.

38:20.548 --> 38:22.466
You're too young to be woeful and alone.

38:22.550 --> 38:25.386
How would you know anything about marriage
when you're a eunuch though?

38:26.637 --> 38:27.972
Do you know what it means to be alone?

38:29.098 --> 38:31.267
Maybe not, but I do know your situation.

38:32.018 --> 38:34.395
If he left home, then at least
there's hope for his return.

38:34.979 --> 38:37.148
Leaving you alone like that,
means it's over.

38:37.231 --> 38:39.275
If he's constantly running around
from room to room,

38:39.358 --> 38:40.359
then just move out already.

38:40.443 --> 38:41.777
You're right, Eunuch Oh.

38:42.570 --> 38:45.197
I won't just stay in a room
all alone ever again.

38:45.281 --> 38:47.074
There you go.
You should cheat on him as well.

38:47.158 --> 38:49.368
Stop giving me indecent solutions to this!

38:50.995 --> 38:54.206
I am saying
I want to find a room of my own.

38:55.541 --> 38:56.709
You don't even have your own room?

38:58.210 --> 39:00.212
I feel anxious
because the room I stay in right now

39:00.296 --> 39:01.213
isn't mine.

39:02.340 --> 39:03.966
That's why he's confused also.

39:05.051 --> 39:06.552
And cannot come to find me, you know.

39:10.931 --> 39:12.350
I shall find a room that's truly mine.

39:13.559 --> 39:15.603
Thanks for the advice though.
It really helped.

39:15.686 --> 39:16.896
It did?

39:19.065 --> 39:20.858
Well, if you fail
to find a room on your own,

39:21.484 --> 39:23.277
I have a lot of empty space.

39:25.029 --> 39:26.280
Where were you going?

39:28.074 --> 39:31.535
My house has so many rooms,
yet none of them make me feel at home.

39:32.286 --> 39:34.663
I guess you could say
it's like I am running away.

39:34.747 --> 39:37.208
You possess a noble energy
of someone who has it all,

39:37.291 --> 39:40.294
but in reality, it seems you, too,
have a peacock that bothers you.

39:41.087 --> 39:42.004
Yes, I do.

39:43.005 --> 39:45.841
There's a guy I really hate
who is too good to be true.

39:46.801 --> 39:48.135
Have you ever heard
of the tale of the crow

39:48.219 --> 39:50.346
that stole the peacock's feathers
and passed them as its own?

39:51.764 --> 39:52.848
I'm that crow now.

39:53.349 --> 39:55.768
If you feel uneasy
showing off what you've stolen,

39:55.851 --> 39:56.852
why don't you get rid of it?

39:58.270 --> 39:59.897
I've done too many awful things already.

40:00.773 --> 40:01.982
I know I'm hopeless now.

40:03.609 --> 40:04.860
You saved this turtle though.

40:06.362 --> 40:08.572
There's no way that it's hopeless for you.

40:12.118 --> 40:14.787
You may be bad at physiognomy,
but you certainly have a way with words.

40:21.419 --> 40:24.255
Thank you for trying to give me
a push with your words.

40:24.338 --> 40:26.132
I need to go finish what I was doing.

40:26.215 --> 40:27.425
Have a safe trip!

40:34.932 --> 40:37.184
Maybe I should visit Jang Uk
instead of going hunting,

40:38.519 --> 40:40.104
since he took care of you as well.

40:50.448 --> 40:52.533
I informed him in advance of your visit.

40:52.616 --> 40:53.951
How dare he not show up?

40:55.077 --> 40:56.495
I'll go and bring Jang Uk right now.

41:08.215 --> 41:12.428
THE FIRE BIRD'S EGG

41:15.431 --> 41:17.308
THE FIRE BIRD

41:20.186 --> 41:21.187
Fire bird.

41:21.770 --> 41:24.899
So Jang Uk already knows about this.

41:34.283 --> 41:35.993
Are you here to reward me?

41:37.203 --> 41:38.162
You can just leave it and go.

41:38.245 --> 41:39.288
The King said…

41:40.206 --> 41:42.875
he'd like to give you
an even bigger award this time around.

41:43.501 --> 41:44.710
He plans to appoint you

41:44.793 --> 41:46.754
general of North Fortress
and send you there.

41:48.047 --> 41:49.006
Is that so?

41:50.007 --> 41:51.383
- That's far.
- If asked…

41:52.635 --> 41:53.469
will you go?

41:53.552 --> 41:57.389
Will that make you feel at ease
if I go that far away?

41:59.099 --> 42:00.351
Don't go if you don't want.

42:01.227 --> 42:02.895
It's true that you're a thorn in my side,

42:03.521 --> 42:05.564
but Jin Mu will always see you
as an obstacle.

42:05.648 --> 42:08.692
It seems you're finally uneasy
about holding hands with Jin Mu.

42:09.610 --> 42:10.778
But unfortunately,

42:11.695 --> 42:15.199
I have no desire
to be used as an obstacle for your sake.

42:19.537 --> 42:22.957
You must be thinking that I am trying
to use you to keep Jin Mu in check, right?

42:23.541 --> 42:24.583
I see.

42:24.667 --> 42:27.378
You won't change your mind
regardless of what I say.

42:27.461 --> 42:29.880
Why exactly are you saying
all of these things to me right now?

42:29.964 --> 42:33.384
- The turtle. Why did you take care of it?
- A turtle?

42:33.467 --> 42:35.886
Yeah, if you hate me so much,
then why did you take care of my turtle?

42:35.970 --> 42:38.472
That turtle was yours?
I thought it was Eunuch Oh's.

42:42.685 --> 42:43.519
That's why.

42:44.603 --> 42:45.896
I see I was mistaken.

42:45.980 --> 42:47.106
Don't tell me

42:47.982 --> 42:49.942
you thought I was showing you favor

42:50.651 --> 42:52.695
because of some turtle.

42:52.778 --> 42:53.862
It's more than just a turtle.

42:55.406 --> 42:57.533
It gave me just enough hope
to come and talk to you

42:58.158 --> 43:00.995
despite the hatred and distrust
you have for me.

43:04.832 --> 43:05.666
Forget it.

43:06.333 --> 43:08.794
Since you've been reading
about the fire bird,

43:09.378 --> 43:10.421
you're not going up north.

43:11.130 --> 43:12.298
What will you do if I go?

43:14.008 --> 43:16.844
You wouldn't do anything
despite knowing how dangerous it is?

43:16.927 --> 43:19.138
I'm glad I left this book open.

43:19.763 --> 43:21.932
I got to see
an interesting expression on your face.

43:23.559 --> 43:25.185
If I did not hate you so much,

43:25.894 --> 43:27.021
I might have actually believed

43:27.104 --> 43:29.315
that you really cared
about the world, Your Highness.

43:32.276 --> 43:34.111
You possess such great power,

43:35.487 --> 43:37.656
yet you're worse than me,
at least I saved a turtle.

43:37.740 --> 43:40.659
That's because there's not a single thing
I wish to protect anymore.

43:40.743 --> 43:41.660
Listen, Jang Uk.

43:41.744 --> 43:44.538
Do you remember
what you said inside the barrier?

43:44.622 --> 43:45.998
You said you'd follow your master.

43:46.081 --> 43:48.250
You'd rather die
instead of doing nothing at all.

43:51.879 --> 43:54.840
You shone bright, even though
you had lost all of your energy.

43:56.258 --> 43:58.552
But now, despite having
such great powers, you are dead.

43:59.136 --> 44:01.472
Fine. Don't do anything, Jang Uk.

44:03.432 --> 44:04.725
Because you're already dead.

44:18.489 --> 44:19.406
What hope?

44:35.631 --> 44:37.883
The tree that I remember
was not this small.

44:39.635 --> 44:41.220
It was a lot bigger and taller.

44:44.515 --> 44:46.016
I was on top of that tree.

44:48.435 --> 44:51.855
The memory of me standing atop
all by myself…

44:53.315 --> 44:54.525
is definitely mine.

45:06.912 --> 45:08.539
I want to climb up again.

45:37.651 --> 45:40.863
Are you in there?
Young Master, are you okay? Hello!

45:41.405 --> 45:42.906
Open the door.

45:42.990 --> 45:44.450
Please, I said open this door!

45:44.533 --> 45:45.868
I'm okay, please just go away.

45:45.951 --> 45:48.245
Oh, you're in pain.
Why haven't you gone to Jinyowon yet?

45:49.705 --> 45:50.539
Fine.

45:50.622 --> 45:52.416
I guess I'll go see Jin Ho-gyeong again.

45:58.088 --> 45:59.506
Why in the world are you doing…

46:01.842 --> 46:03.302
Why are you doing this to yourself?

46:05.888 --> 46:07.514
Because I want to make up for…

46:08.515 --> 46:09.767
the regrets I always feel.

46:12.770 --> 46:14.021
This pain here…

46:17.566 --> 46:19.276
is greater than what I usually feel.

46:20.986 --> 46:22.613
You gave me a chance to do that.

46:23.864 --> 46:25.199
I really thank you for that.

46:28.494 --> 46:29.787
So you do not need to…

46:36.084 --> 46:37.377
…do anything more for me.

46:39.630 --> 46:40.631
You've done enough.

46:43.759 --> 46:45.719
Young Lady Heo gave me medicine
for my pain.

46:47.846 --> 46:49.014
I'll give some to you.

46:51.058 --> 46:53.227
Please take it… for me.

47:05.072 --> 47:07.658
Since she's still alive
with the blood parasite

47:07.741 --> 47:11.286
in the core of her energy,
she must have a high tolerance for pain.

47:12.246 --> 47:13.080
However,

47:13.831 --> 47:17.042
if the blood parasite's energy
flows the wrong way,

47:17.793 --> 47:20.003
she is going to die from agony.

47:22.172 --> 47:24.174
She'll need my help if she wishes to live.

47:24.716 --> 47:27.970
She'll think twice
about revealing Bu-yeon's secret.

47:28.554 --> 47:31.223
But… is there a way to get rid of it

47:32.391 --> 47:33.767
once it reaches one's energy?

47:39.022 --> 47:40.440
Insects are always eaten by…

47:42.693 --> 47:43.527
birds.

47:49.950 --> 47:53.579
It seems Jin Bu-yeon is
a more powerful priestess than I expected.

47:53.662 --> 47:55.664
She has started to regain
her divine powers?

47:55.747 --> 47:59.251
You said once she regained her memories,
her powers would return.

47:59.334 --> 48:00.168
I did not.

48:00.252 --> 48:02.754
Once she regains her powers,
her memories will return.

48:03.797 --> 48:04.923
Isn't that the same thing?

48:06.466 --> 48:07.551
Have her continue looking.

48:17.227 --> 48:19.229
Once Jin Bu-yeon's powers return,

48:19.980 --> 48:22.190
the lost memories will return to Naksu,

48:22.983 --> 48:25.152
and she'll be driven from the body.

48:37.205 --> 48:39.708
See! I got a Songrim Spirit Plaque.

48:40.709 --> 48:43.545
I'm allowed to enter freely,
just like a Jeongjingak mage.

48:43.629 --> 48:45.964
Seeing you with that makes it seem like

48:46.048 --> 48:49.051
the effort I had to put in to get one
was a complete waste of time.

48:49.134 --> 48:50.427
It took a lot of effort?

48:51.261 --> 48:53.931
You are a bad student?
What was your class rank?

48:54.014 --> 48:58.185
I reached Chisu faster than anyone
once my gate of energy was finally opened.

48:58.769 --> 49:00.312
You must have trained hard.

49:00.395 --> 49:01.897
That's because someone…

49:02.856 --> 49:05.525
put my life at risk
if I didn't do my very best.

49:05.609 --> 49:06.443
Who?

49:07.986 --> 49:08.820
My…

49:11.239 --> 49:12.282
old master.

49:15.911 --> 49:19.998
My master was tough, always pushing me
to my limits, to the brink of death.

49:20.082 --> 49:21.041
Thanks to that,

49:21.875 --> 49:23.543
I always continued to improve myself.

49:24.461 --> 49:26.088
My master never allowed me

49:26.713 --> 49:28.048
to ever quit and do nothing.

49:29.549 --> 49:31.760
If you are not going to do anything,
you might as well die.

49:36.974 --> 49:37.808
What?

49:38.976 --> 49:40.894
Are you confused again?

49:42.187 --> 49:44.523
I really have no idea
who's saying these things anymore.

49:48.110 --> 49:49.236
But it is strange.

49:49.319 --> 49:51.154
I've heard it multiple times today.

49:51.947 --> 49:53.156
Maybe because I wanted to quit.

49:53.240 --> 49:54.616
What do you mean?

49:55.242 --> 49:57.411
Were you planning
to give up on everything?

49:58.870 --> 49:59.705
Yeah.

50:01.164 --> 50:02.249
I thought that…

50:03.583 --> 50:05.752
I'd finally found a way
to get rid of this heavy burden.

50:08.839 --> 50:09.673
It's…

50:11.633 --> 50:12.926
really that hard for you?

50:21.101 --> 50:24.062
Lord Park told me I was incredible
when he gave this to me.

50:24.688 --> 50:26.690
I'll slowly regain more of my powers,

50:28.066 --> 50:29.317
and I'll use them…

50:32.320 --> 50:33.405
to protect you, okay?

50:35.157 --> 50:36.700
This also confuses me.

50:37.868 --> 50:38.785
About what it is…

50:40.579 --> 50:41.663
that I really want from you.

50:43.040 --> 50:43.874
I…

50:45.000 --> 50:46.084
plan to find my own room.

50:48.045 --> 50:51.339
I will try my best to find out
who I really am and decorate it well.

50:54.176 --> 50:55.010
So that…

50:57.345 --> 50:58.764
you don't get confused anymore.

51:10.692 --> 51:12.235
I will make it…

51:13.445 --> 51:14.821
a warm, comfortable place for you.

51:37.636 --> 51:39.930
I barely advanced the hearing for it

51:40.013 --> 51:42.307
and you threw everything I planned for
in the lake?

51:43.350 --> 51:45.393
I was afraid of getting caught,
so I had no choice.

51:45.477 --> 51:49.523
So-i will be in charge, once more,
of importing our goods into the capital.

51:51.733 --> 51:52.567
Bring her here.

51:53.068 --> 51:55.070
So-i has not been seen
for quite a while now.

51:55.153 --> 51:58.657
As long as the parasite is in her,
she cannot escape my control.

51:59.491 --> 52:00.700
Once she shows, bring her here.

52:01.660 --> 52:02.577
Yes.

52:11.086 --> 52:12.003
Show them this letter.

52:13.463 --> 52:14.631
They are going to take care of you.

52:15.590 --> 52:17.801
Young Master, when are you going
to visit Jin Ho-gyeong?

52:17.884 --> 52:19.177
You don't have time to waste.

52:19.970 --> 52:20.804
I know.

52:21.930 --> 52:23.014
Please come back alive.

52:24.641 --> 52:28.353
Once you feel better,
you'll also return to Seoho Fortress?

52:33.066 --> 52:34.109
Please have a safe trip.

52:58.091 --> 52:59.176
I'm trying to pick

53:00.177 --> 53:01.636
a lucky date for us.

53:02.554 --> 53:03.638
Let's get married then.

53:03.722 --> 53:04.806
Please.

53:07.934 --> 53:10.020
I'll also need to decide
for Young Master Jang.

53:11.354 --> 53:16.109
Let us invite every single person
in your family to our wedding.

53:17.194 --> 53:19.404
I'll send over a large boat for them.

53:19.487 --> 53:20.447
Thank you so much.

53:22.032 --> 53:24.242
Who should I invite
to Young Master Jang's wedding?

53:25.744 --> 53:28.121
He has no family
so I don't want him to feel empty.

53:30.040 --> 53:33.627
Maidservant Kim,
why are you peeling these?

53:33.710 --> 53:35.462
Young Master Jang loves chestnut rice.

53:38.131 --> 53:38.965
I'm hurt.

53:39.633 --> 53:41.176
Whatever we talk about,

53:42.427 --> 53:43.303
Uk comes first.

53:43.386 --> 53:46.681
Oh, well, he is my young master after all.

53:47.515 --> 53:49.059
And I worry about him a lot.

53:51.561 --> 53:52.646
Here.

53:52.729 --> 53:55.315
If Uk and I were drowning
just like this here,

53:55.815 --> 53:57.525
who would you save first then?

53:59.194 --> 54:03.448
I wouldn't need to save either of you
since both of you can swim very well.

54:03.531 --> 54:04.908
What if we could not though?

54:04.991 --> 54:07.869
And we were both floundering
in the water, grasping for air?

54:07.953 --> 54:11.206
Whose name do you think
you'd call first? Who?

54:13.416 --> 54:14.251
Well…

54:16.878 --> 54:18.296
- J-Ja--
- You'll…

54:18.380 --> 54:20.674
shout "Young Master!"

54:23.593 --> 54:25.512
You will save only Uk.

54:25.595 --> 54:26.554
You will not…

54:28.056 --> 54:29.474
care about Jin at all.

54:29.557 --> 54:31.518
Then what about you, my lord?
Did you not say

54:31.601 --> 54:34.271
that you would close the door
even if I were going to die inside?

54:34.354 --> 54:36.189
- When did I say that?
- For real!

54:37.482 --> 54:40.068
Fine, then,
let me ask you one more time, hmm?

54:40.986 --> 54:44.281
I am, uh, trapped inside
an extremely dangerous room,

54:45.073 --> 54:47.409
but you must absolutely
close the door, no matter what.

54:47.492 --> 54:51.997
In that case, would you just
close the door or not close it?

54:54.666 --> 54:57.585
But how urgent is the situation?

54:58.253 --> 54:59.671
If I don't close the door,

55:00.630 --> 55:03.758
- would the entire world be in danger?
- I knew it!

55:04.843 --> 55:06.594
You can't be that objective about it.

55:06.678 --> 55:08.680
I told you I'm in danger.

55:08.763 --> 55:10.598
Your betrothed will die.

55:10.682 --> 55:13.476
Please, do not concoct
such a heartbreaking scenario.

55:14.644 --> 55:15.645
You will…

55:16.313 --> 55:17.814
never be in danger

55:18.982 --> 55:20.275
with me, ever.

55:23.403 --> 55:25.822
Even if you do decide
to close that door, my lord,

55:26.823 --> 55:30.160
I know just how heartbreaking
it will be for you,

55:31.119 --> 55:32.579
so it doesn't upset me much.

55:33.997 --> 55:37.208
So, if I call "Uk" at first,

55:38.126 --> 55:40.086
know that it is not because…

55:40.587 --> 55:43.381
my affection for my darling Jin
is in any way smaller.

55:44.758 --> 55:45.925
I was foolish.

55:46.509 --> 55:47.510
My question…

55:48.303 --> 55:53.308
posed such a terrible choice where someone
who you love so much would have to die.

55:56.353 --> 55:57.187
Both should be saved.

55:58.772 --> 56:01.191
At all costs, both should be saved.

56:06.237 --> 56:08.990
Well, neither of you will ever drown.

56:38.061 --> 56:41.022
Tear it out and crush the heart.

56:42.023 --> 56:44.317
So you wish to go to Danhyanggok?

56:45.235 --> 56:46.152
Wh-Why there?

56:46.236 --> 56:50.323
I heard about a gigantic tree there,
and I really want to see it for myself.

56:50.407 --> 56:52.409
It's true that there's a tree.

56:53.410 --> 56:54.911
I went with Uk and Yul.

56:57.038 --> 56:58.665
We've seen the tree together.

56:58.748 --> 57:01.084
The tree that I wish to see
is actually my tree.

57:01.167 --> 57:02.293
Huh?

57:03.503 --> 57:05.463
I remember a very big tree there,

57:06.172 --> 57:07.382
and I wish to see it…

57:08.883 --> 57:09.968
if it really exists.

57:10.718 --> 57:11.553
Uh…

57:12.053 --> 57:16.433
I'm not sure we're talking
about the same tree, but it's really tall.

57:16.933 --> 57:17.976
It will be easy for you to find.

57:18.768 --> 57:22.355
I would love to escort you there myself,
but I'm busy.

57:22.439 --> 57:24.983
Shall I have
someone guide you to Danhyanggok?

57:25.066 --> 57:27.068
I will ask
if I need someone to do so.

57:27.152 --> 57:28.736
Are you going to Danhyanggok?

57:29.612 --> 57:31.114
Oh, good!

57:31.197 --> 57:33.199
Yul knows his way around there
better than me.

57:33.741 --> 57:35.243
He went there a lot when he was young.

57:35.326 --> 57:36.828
I also wanted to go there.

57:37.787 --> 57:38.997
Shall we go?

57:39.080 --> 57:42.125
Oh, great, Yul can take you there.
You can go together.

57:42.709 --> 57:43.918
I heard it's dangerous though.

57:45.128 --> 57:46.087
Is that fine, Yul?

57:46.671 --> 57:47.505
Yes.

57:48.923 --> 57:50.175
Let's go there together.

57:56.181 --> 57:57.765
THE FIRE BIRD

58:01.644 --> 58:03.188
It looks like these people

58:03.855 --> 58:06.232
are trying to do the same thing
by waking the bird.

58:06.316 --> 58:09.194
You wouldn't do anything
despite knowing how dangerous it is?

58:11.779 --> 58:14.115
If you are not going to do anything,
you might as well die.

58:37.055 --> 58:38.932
I promise you I don't have that stone!

58:39.516 --> 58:41.309
If she really doesn't carry it with her…

58:43.144 --> 58:44.562
it must be somewhere in here.

58:55.198 --> 58:56.199
What?

58:57.283 --> 58:58.493
You've come awfully quick, Jang Uk.

59:00.870 --> 59:02.956
What? You can't sleep again?

59:03.039 --> 59:04.082
Do you want me to hold you?

59:04.165 --> 59:05.625
How will that help me sleep though?

59:06.209 --> 59:08.336
Look, I just came here to check something…

59:09.379 --> 59:11.881
if you have the yin-yang jade in here.

59:21.015 --> 59:22.684
See. I keep it here.

59:25.395 --> 59:26.479
So what you said…

59:27.605 --> 59:28.898
was really your memories then?

59:30.316 --> 59:31.317
It is strange.

59:32.735 --> 59:34.529
That's why
I'm going to Danhyanggok tomorrow.

59:34.612 --> 59:35.822
Danhyanggok?

59:35.905 --> 59:36.823
I want to see the tree.

59:37.949 --> 59:39.742
You told me
that the tree was there, right?

59:41.911 --> 59:45.623
I want to see it for myself
if it actually exists.

59:46.874 --> 59:48.876
My memories are confused because of it.

59:49.460 --> 59:51.713
But I know one thing, that tree…

59:52.630 --> 59:54.674
was in my mind long before I even met you.

59:57.468 --> 01:00:00.555
If I see it, I'm sure
it'll help me figure things out.

01:00:02.348 --> 01:00:04.058
Okay, then go see yourself.

01:00:04.142 --> 01:00:04.976
- I will--
- Actually, Yul and I are going

01:00:05.059 --> 01:00:06.019
together tomorrow.

01:00:08.229 --> 01:00:09.606
- With Yul?
- I said I wanted to go

01:00:09.689 --> 01:00:11.649
and then he said that he'd come too.

01:00:13.359 --> 01:00:15.111
Hey, why would you bother him?

01:00:15.194 --> 01:00:16.988
He said he wanted
to go to Danhyanggok too.

01:00:17.071 --> 01:00:20.408
He is my friend. He couldn't refuse
to help you only because of me.

01:00:20.491 --> 01:00:22.952
- He's my friend as well.
- He's my friend.

01:00:23.036 --> 01:00:24.370
So you can't be his friend!

01:00:24.454 --> 01:00:26.164
- Why not?
- Yul is my friend.

01:00:26.247 --> 01:00:28.166
If he's your friend, then we are friends.

01:00:28.249 --> 01:00:29.125
Can we not even be friends?

01:00:29.208 --> 01:00:31.169
How can you be a friend
if you hold me at night?

01:00:54.859 --> 01:00:55.693
Have fun…

01:00:57.320 --> 01:00:59.072
at Danhyanggok with your friend tomorrow.

01:01:03.117 --> 01:01:04.744
I mean it's cool if you two are friends.

01:01:20.301 --> 01:01:21.219
You've lost it, Uk.

01:01:35.483 --> 01:01:37.110
So this is Danhyanggok.

01:01:37.777 --> 01:01:39.070
What a nice view!

01:01:42.073 --> 01:01:44.742
Did you say you came here before?

01:01:45.702 --> 01:01:47.078
- Right.
- Hmm.

01:01:48.287 --> 01:01:49.956
This is the place where we first met.

01:01:50.039 --> 01:01:52.750
So did we meet a long time ago?

01:01:56.337 --> 01:01:57.839
I used to come here to visit you.

01:02:01.259 --> 01:02:03.136
I didn't let my broken leg stop me.

01:02:04.470 --> 01:02:06.347
I wasn't afraid to get scolded either…

01:02:12.186 --> 01:02:13.688
because I liked you so much.

01:02:16.023 --> 01:02:17.734
I couldn't help what I felt.

01:02:19.652 --> 01:02:21.446
Despite knowing who you were,
I did nothing,

01:02:21.529 --> 01:02:23.448
and lived my life full of regrets.

01:02:26.200 --> 01:02:28.161
I'm glad I noticed you first, this time.

01:02:30.455 --> 01:02:32.123
I can do what I should have.

01:02:58.566 --> 01:03:01.277
Young Master. Young Master Seo.

01:03:04.864 --> 01:03:06.574
What were you just thinking about?

01:03:07.158 --> 01:03:09.285
Master Heo wishes to see you right now.

01:03:15.124 --> 01:03:16.459
I heard from my granddaughter

01:03:16.542 --> 01:03:18.961
that you helped hide So-i.

01:03:19.045 --> 01:03:20.254
She's already gone.

01:03:20.797 --> 01:03:22.507
I sent her far away, so do not worry.

01:03:23.716 --> 01:03:24.550
Then why…

01:03:25.259 --> 01:03:27.261
are you avoiding me?

01:03:27.762 --> 01:03:32.266
Do you still resent me
for dragging you back home to Seoho?

01:03:32.850 --> 01:03:34.477
You're the last of the Seo line

01:03:34.560 --> 01:03:37.605
and I did not want you involved
with Naksu either.

01:03:37.688 --> 01:03:38.815
I know all that.

01:03:44.195 --> 01:03:45.947
Oh, you don't look well at all, Yul.

01:03:46.531 --> 01:03:48.699
Let me examine you. Come!

01:03:48.783 --> 01:03:51.452
I need to go
somewhere right now. I'll come…

01:03:55.957 --> 01:03:56.874
once I return.

01:03:56.958 --> 01:03:58.459
Yeah, okay.

01:03:59.877 --> 01:04:02.046
If you don't, I will go and get you.

01:04:03.256 --> 01:04:04.090
Yeah.

01:04:05.633 --> 01:04:06.843
I'm so sorry, Master.

01:04:08.678 --> 01:04:09.595
I really wish you well.

01:04:19.313 --> 01:04:24.110
Madam, what made you so concerned
that you had to return?

01:04:24.193 --> 01:04:27.196
I promise that we will leave
as soon as I see him go to Jinyowon.

01:04:27.280 --> 01:04:29.866
Why do you care so much about him?

01:04:31.993 --> 01:04:33.661
You like him?

01:04:39.083 --> 01:04:40.626
The only world I knew…

01:04:42.503 --> 01:04:44.171
was always so filthy and dark.

01:04:46.591 --> 01:04:48.801
Back when I was swindling people,

01:04:50.636 --> 01:04:52.013
I met the Young Master.

01:04:55.308 --> 01:04:57.059
After that, everything…

01:04:59.896 --> 01:05:01.147
was so much cleaner…

01:05:04.108 --> 01:05:05.151
and much brighter.

01:05:23.294 --> 01:05:24.128
That's…

01:05:25.463 --> 01:05:26.464
just how I felt.

01:05:26.547 --> 01:05:28.382
Well, let's check.

01:05:30.009 --> 01:05:31.385
I'll go buy us food first.

01:05:57.411 --> 01:06:01.082
I see you all have taken over
since I stepped out for a bit.

01:06:14.679 --> 01:06:17.556
You… were trying to run.

01:06:18.224 --> 01:06:21.560
You couldn't possibly think of doing that
with the blood parasite in you.

01:06:22.144 --> 01:06:24.522
So then, you figured out
how to take it out?

01:06:37.326 --> 01:06:39.537
Tell me the truth
if you don't want to die.

01:06:40.162 --> 01:06:41.956
Did you really take the parasite out?

01:06:49.839 --> 01:06:51.173
Maidservant Kim made us lunch.

01:06:52.008 --> 01:06:53.718
What beautiful weather!

01:06:54.635 --> 01:06:55.886
This feels like a picnic.

01:06:57.805 --> 01:06:59.181
Did you get to say goodbye to Uk?

01:06:59.890 --> 01:07:02.601
I did. He told me
to have fun with your friend.

01:07:04.770 --> 01:07:05.604
Right.

01:07:06.522 --> 01:07:07.523
Are you not…

01:07:08.858 --> 01:07:10.109
still sick?

01:07:10.192 --> 01:07:12.278
I did what you said and didn't tell Uk.

01:07:17.033 --> 01:07:18.075
I'm sorry.

01:07:19.827 --> 01:07:20.786
Young Master!

01:07:23.956 --> 01:07:25.041
What's going on?

01:07:25.666 --> 01:07:27.251
- You should have left now.
- Back there…

01:07:27.334 --> 01:07:29.378
Madam So-i has been captured
by Cheonbugwan right now.

01:07:30.629 --> 01:07:31.839
What's a blood parasite?

01:07:32.548 --> 01:07:34.759
They are beating her,
saying she no longer has it.

01:07:36.093 --> 01:07:37.470
Is she being held at that gambling den?

01:07:37.553 --> 01:07:38.387
Yeah.

01:07:45.144 --> 01:07:46.979
Who has the parasite now?

01:07:47.063 --> 01:07:48.647
Who did you give the medicine to?

01:07:48.731 --> 01:07:51.901
I took the medicine!

01:07:53.986 --> 01:07:56.072
I thought it was good for me.

01:07:58.240 --> 01:07:59.366
Tell me the truth now,

01:08:00.076 --> 01:08:02.453
or Gwanju will soon crush you
to little pieces.

01:08:10.836 --> 01:08:11.879
Put it down!

01:08:11.962 --> 01:08:14.590
Put it back! Put it down!

01:08:15.091 --> 01:08:17.510
Put it back! Put that down!

01:08:19.053 --> 01:08:20.096
Put that down!

01:08:20.179 --> 01:08:22.640
No! No! Put it back!

01:08:30.689 --> 01:08:32.733
A blood parasite? What is that?

01:08:33.275 --> 01:08:34.652
I'm not sure either.

01:08:35.694 --> 01:08:36.904
But that's what I heard.

01:08:38.823 --> 01:08:40.908
There's something I haven't told you yet.

01:08:44.495 --> 01:08:46.122
He told me not to tell you but…

01:08:51.752 --> 01:08:53.003
…Seo Yul is very ill.

01:08:56.132 --> 01:08:58.425
I saw a strange energy inside him.

01:08:59.218 --> 01:09:01.637
I think it's the blood parasite.

01:09:09.687 --> 01:09:11.689
Take everything
So-i took from Cheonbugwan.

01:09:11.772 --> 01:09:12.773
- Yes.
- Yes.

01:09:45.973 --> 01:09:48.475
Seo Yul. So, are you the person
she was trying to hide?

01:09:48.559 --> 01:09:50.728
She's coming with me. Move aside.

01:09:52.188 --> 01:09:54.315
So-i knows
too many secrets of the Gwanju.

01:09:54.857 --> 01:09:56.942
If Songrim takes her, I'm done for.

01:09:57.026 --> 01:09:57.943
She's staying.

01:09:58.527 --> 01:10:00.112
Cheonbugwan is looking for her.

01:10:04.408 --> 01:10:05.284
I said move now!

01:10:05.367 --> 01:10:08.579
- Why would a man like you protect such--
- I cannot allow you

01:10:09.538 --> 01:10:11.332
to just take So-i back to Jin Mu.

01:10:31.852 --> 01:10:33.479
I must end it quickly.

01:10:34.146 --> 01:10:36.023
It's dangerous to use
too much of my energy.

01:10:44.615 --> 01:10:45.491
The parasite?

01:10:48.744 --> 01:10:50.037
So So-i's parasite…

01:10:51.247 --> 01:10:52.748
is inside Seo Yul's body.

01:11:58.689 --> 01:11:59.523
So-i.

01:12:11.201 --> 01:12:13.746
I am glad
that the world I get to see…

01:12:15.456 --> 01:12:16.790
before I die…

01:12:18.876 --> 01:12:20.502
was a clean…

01:12:23.547 --> 01:12:24.715
…and bright one.

01:12:29.928 --> 01:12:30.846
Please…

01:12:33.015 --> 01:12:34.308
continue living.

01:13:00.084 --> 01:13:03.754
I don't know how a nobleman
got involved with the likes of her.

01:13:04.630 --> 01:13:06.382
But now that things have come to this,

01:13:06.965 --> 01:13:08.258
I can't let you leave alive.

01:14:53.822 --> 01:14:54.656
Yul.

01:14:56.408 --> 01:14:57.284
Yul.

01:14:59.453 --> 01:15:01.413
Uk.

01:15:03.499 --> 01:15:04.458
I'm sorry.

01:15:38.659 --> 01:15:40.285
Not a single person here…

01:15:42.246 --> 01:15:43.872
will leave this place alive.

01:16:08.689 --> 01:16:11.608
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:16:12.192 --> 01:16:13.610
Who put it in So-i's body?

01:16:14.152 --> 01:16:15.487
Jin Mu?

01:16:16.446 --> 01:16:18.615
Jang Uk is not to enter Cheonbugwan,
you hear me?

01:16:21.159 --> 01:16:22.744
If Seo Yul really dies because of this,

01:16:22.828 --> 01:16:25.872
Songrim and Cheonbugwan
will break out into a clash.

01:16:27.082 --> 01:16:30.043
She said she didn't want to know,
so I plan to reveal it.

01:16:31.169 --> 01:16:32.754
You can have three breaths.

01:16:32.838 --> 01:16:35.549
You said you don't remember
who you are, right?

01:16:35.632 --> 01:16:39.428
Yes, because her blue marks
blossomed like flowers in her eyes.
